    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovation has come to the gaming industry! This retro inspired arcade game is a two player local co-op game that pits each player against each other with a first to 3 format. With collision detection on both the x and y axis, this adds a new dimension of hit detection to the classic arcade ping pong game.\u00a0</p>",
